# Festival of Embers lets "instant and sorcery spells" be cast from your graveyard, judged on the face being cast (CR 715.3, 715.3a):
# Bonecrusher Giant, discarded to Faithless Looting on turn 1, is cast from Bot1's graveyard on turn 5 as Stomp (an instant - Adventure)
# for {1}{R} and the Festival's 1 life (Bot1 19), dealing 2 to Bot2 (18), while the Giant itself, a creature spell, is refused though the
# mana is there (Mox Jet still untapped). Stomp, cast as an Adventure, goes on its adventure in exile as it resolves (CR 715.3d).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Faithless Looting
Bonecrusher Giant
Festival of Embers
Mountain x12

